{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53418","headline":"偈 · 隐峯","name":"偈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"独弦琴子爲君弹，松栢长青不怕（《宋高僧传》作「怯」）寒。\n金鑛相和性自别，任向君前试取看。\n（见《祖堂集》卷十五、《宋高僧传》卷二一）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"隐峯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53418.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53418","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}